# Peerless Recycling, gift a card promised (CR 702.174a, 702.174j): the opponent draws first, then "instead return two target permanent cards from your
# graveyard to your hand". One target alone, three, and the Lightning Bolt (an instant card, not a permanent card) are refused; an Ornithopter and the Memnite
# return together and the other Ornithopter and the Bolt stay. Bot2's hand is one card bigger (3) than without the gift (2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Peerless Recycling
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

